          <attvalue for="11" value="agreement ... fifty compact bundles of Chinese, and five of Tibetan, text rolls | allow me to acquire some twenty more bundles of Chinese manuscripts ... against an appropriate donation | another big share ... over two hundred and thirty compact bundles" />
